# `requirement` id is used as the map scope); the offline gate drives the REAL merged
# ControlMappingService under the local profile and checks the mapped control families,
# coverage verdict and citation against these expectations.
#
# The offline/local deterministic mapper (LocalDeterministicLLMAdapter.REQUIREMENT_CONTROL_MAP)
