# from the live local seed posture (residency controls ENABLED, CMEK MISCONFIGURED, WORM audit
# log DISABLED), which is exactly why mas-data-residency resolves FULL and the APRA/HKMA rows
# resolve NONE. The richer 10-example production set is scored by the model-quality-gate / Gen AI gate.
